msgid "DLC@RISEFROMRUIN@TSR_FINISHER@TOOLTIP@HEAL_FORECAST"
msgstr "As long as you hold at least three <<m:{GLOBAL.ArtifactConcept.Hyperlink}>>:[bulletlist][bullet/]You become known as the Mender of the Fractured Age. From now on, the <<m:{GLOBAL.DomainConcept.Hyperlink}>> of your {GLOBAL.EmpireConcept.Hyperlink} can no longer be targeted by <<m:{GLOBAL.CataclysmConcept.Hyperlink}>>. Does not work when a {GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink} was already targeted by a Cataclysm and then becomes your domain.[bullet/]At the beginning of your {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, the {GLOBAL.CataclysmConcept.Hyperlink} meter progress and level will decrease, stabilizing the realm. When the Cataclysm level reaches 0, the world will be cleansed of the fractured energy. Destroying the cataclysm and the artifacts, and ceasing any unfinished Fated Region.[bullet/]At the beginning of your {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, nomads will pilgrimage to your cities, seeking to join the one who put an end to the [hyperlink,GLOBAL.FractureLoreConcept]Fractures[/hyperlink]. This will increase their {GLOBAL.PopulationConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}.[bulletlist]"

