msgstr "Bênção Astral:[bulletlist][bullet/]Cura {healAmount} adicional<<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink}>>[bullet/]Remove {GENERAL_DISPEL_NEGATIVE>NumThingsToDispel} {GLOBAL.NegativeStatusEffectConcept.Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

